<title>NORWAY: Norway 2007 expansion gets high yield of 6.07 pct.</title>
<headline>Norway 2007 expansion gets high yield of 6.07 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Norwegian central bank.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Finance Ministry</p>
<p>MATURITY: January 15, 2007</p>
<p>COUPON: 6.75 percent</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.07 percent</p>
<p>BID AMOUNT/COVER: 2.0 billion crowns</p>
<p>NOTES: This is an expansion of government bond S467.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
